@@ -37,0 +40,42 @@ wacli groups prune [--days N] [--left-only=false|--include-active] [--dry-run] [
+## Coordinated snapshot producer contract
+
+`wacli store snapshot plan` is an offline, source-only capability query. It emits
+one plain JSON object (one newline-terminated record; no success/data envelope)
+and does not resolve configuration, discover a store, acquire `LOCK`, or open
+either database. The current fixed contract is:
+
+```json
+{
+  "protocol": "wacli-coordinated-snapshot-v1",
+  "status": "blocked",
+  "capture_enabled": false,
+  "complete": false,
+  "publishable": false,
+  "boundary": "UNVERIFIED",
+  "cross_database_consistency": "NOT_CERTIFIED",
+  "windows_validated": false
+}
+```
+
+The eight fields above are the complete producer capability contract. The
+`status`, `capture_enabled`, `complete`, `publishable`, boundary, consistency,
+and validation fields are all negative until the required backend exists.
+`wacli store snapshot create` is deliberately fail-closed and exits with an
+explicit error before source discovery, source reads, locking, or artifact
+creation. Mainframe must match the protocol and all false/negative fields above;
+receipt acceptance is not enabled, and an arbitrary user-supplied receipt cannot
+certify a snapshot.
+
+A future implementation must fence **all writers** (including a running sync
+and its delegated send/state writers), drain them, and establish a validated
+capture window before it can claim completion. The snapshot must include both
+`session.db` and `wacli.db` plus the media paths referenced by the database;
+partial media membership cannot be published as a complete snapshot. SQLite
+backup or file copying alone is not an all-writer consistency proof.
+
+On Linux, restoring a complete snapshot can restore local databases and files,
+subject to the usual filesystem ownership/permission requirements. Restoration
+does not prove that the linked-device credentials remain usable: WhatsApp may
+invalidate or require re-pairing of session credentials, so credential
+usability must be checked separately and is never implied by a restored store.
+
